<div aria-hidden="true" style="display:none" data-orlando-about>
  <p>Hi, I'm Anthony! I'm a corporate magician and mentalist (mind reader) and I'm obsessed with traveling. I've always loved to entertain people; it seems to be engraved in my nature. My parents enrolled me in acting classes at age five, so I've always felt really comfortable on stage. After years of performing in musicals and plays, I began touring the United States, performing magic and mentalism at trade shows and conventions.</p>
  <p>I've appeared in commercials, print advertisements, television shows, and movies; but nothing compares to performing magic and mentalism for a live audience. I love the thrill of entertaining people, and I've been fortunate enough to have done so all over the United States and on four continents. From celebrities to CEOs, I can bring a laugh and a smile to anyone. My wit, charm, and clean humor give a personal moment of astonishment to every guest. Whether it's in Florida or another country, I look forward to giving your event a unique and magical touch!</p>
  <p>Anthony Dempsey</p>
</div>
